            "review_title": "Review at 10am hostel Cafe & food",
            "review_text": "Leeli_10\nYork, United Kingdom5 contributions\n0\nWarm Welcome\nOct 2017 • Solo\nMy sleeper bus arrived in Ha Giang much earlier than expected (4.30AM). Given that my check-in time at a local homestay was not until much later in the morning I subsequently found myself 'stranded' in the town centre. A woman passing by (who I believe was rather perturbed to see a solo female traveller at that time in the morning!) insisted that I phone the owner of 10AM cafe to see whether it would be possible to have a cup of tea. After a quick phone call which clearly woke her up, the owner came downstairs and kindly let me in. She was so welcoming, supplying me with tea and later inviting me to lie down on one of the sofas. After a rest I ordered a breakfast of scrambled eggs which was delicious. She also ordered a taxi on my behalf and contacted the owner of the village homestay to advise that I was on my way. The kindness and generosity they demonstrated was second to none, and ever so much appreciated. Would highly recommend.\nRead more\nWritten October 20, 2017",
